  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Based on the latest [patch notes](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202542) I feel it'd be nice to be able to have a Spout Stream Component made available for the Camera component in the Avatars SDK, mostly because we have the `Face Mirror Spout Stream` option in the menu, and as much as I'd be okay with it I feel that many users such as myself would benefit a lot more if we had a way to access a feature like that for our own models we've uploaded to our accounts. It can be a Custom Render Texture component or shader parameters made accessible to shader authors so they can play around with the final output, or both.",
